<title>SPAIN: Spain's Union Fenosa Q1 net up 1.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Union Fenosa Q1 net up 1.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are first quarter results of Spanish electrical company Union Fenosa, in billion pesetas unless stated:</p>
<p>    Group Net Profit		11.24	    up 1.8 PCT</p>
<p>    Parent Net Profit	     10.45	    up 1.5 PCT</p>
<p>NOTE - The company added in a statement its operating revenues were down 0.9 percent in the period. Amortisation were 9.2 percent higher. The company confirmed a report earlier on Spanish agency.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
